<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Contact Us | Skill Record</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body style="background: var(--bg-darker); padding: 60px 20px;">

    <div class="auth-card" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 30px;">Contact Us</h2>
        
        <div style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8;">
            <p>We would love to hear from you! Whether you have a question about features, pricing, need a demo, or anything else, our team is ready to answer all your questions.</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">Get In Touch</strong></p>
            
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <span style="color: var(--accent);">support@skillrecord.com</span></p>
            <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +1 (555) 123-4567</p>
            <p><strong>Address:</strong> 123 Education Lane, Tech District, Innovation City</p>

            <p><strong style="color: white; display: block; margin-top: 24px;">Support Hours</strong>
            Our support team is available Monday through Friday, 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM (EST).</p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 40px;">
            <button type="button" class="cta-btn cta-btn-secondary" style="flex: 1;" onclick="window.location.href='/'">Go Back Home</button>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
